  "title": "Double Hashing",
  "parentId": "sec-open-addressing",
  "hidden": false,
  "markdown": "#### Double Hashing\n\n$$\\boxed{h(k,i)=(h_1(k)+i\\,h_2(k))\\bmod m}$$\n\n*h₁(k) = Initial Index；h₂(k) = Step Size；i = Probe Number。*\n\n- Step = h₂(k)（非固定 +1）\n- 为确保探测能访问全部 m 个 Slot，通常要求 $\\gcd(h_2(k),m)=1$",
